00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:48.580
A beast-lord?

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:16.650
Erin could only stare and watch the giant shadow fly overhead.

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:29.330
But that shadow made a strong impression of the beast-lords in Erin's mind.

00:24:02.090 --> 00:24:05.160
The big shadow and white feather I saw in the mist...

00:24:05.160 --> 00:24:06.660
Was that a beast-lord?

00:24:07.030 --> 00:24:13.150
One morning at the summer cabin, Jone Oji-san goes to a valley, where Touda live, to gather chigo flower roots.

00:24:13.720 --> 00:24:19.990
I get worried so I follow him, but a rope hangs down into the valley.

00:24:19.990 --> 00:24:21.990
Is it Oji-san who did that?

00:24:21.990 --> 00:24:24.990
Kemono no Souja Erin.  The Valley of the Beast-Lord.

00:24:25.010 --> 00:24:29.990
The Valley of the Beast-Lord
